<div class="mandarin-hanzi">超市</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">chāoshì</div>

''Meaning:'' supermarket  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我去超市买鸡蛋和牛奶。 — Wǒ qù chāoshì mǎi jīdàn hé niúnǎi. — I’m going to the supermarket to buy eggs and milk.

!! Usage note
去超市买东西 (qù chāoshì mǎi dōngxi) means 'go shopping at the supermarket'. 超市 is a retail store, not an open-air 市场 (shìchǎng, 'market').
